# {{name}}

A pinball machine built with [vukery](https://github.com/vukery/vukery).

```console
uv sync            # install vukery and the test tools
uv run vuk me      # play it on your computer, with the dashboard
uv run vuk you     # run the specs
VUK_ENV=production uv run vuk us   # run it on the machine
```

- `config/`: the machine (switches, coils, devices, displays), with
  `config/environments/` for development and production;
- `modes/`: the game's logic, one mode per folder;
- `assets/`: sounds, images, videos and fonts, named by file name;
- `tests/`: the specs.
